# Cyber Sled vector sprites. T: a picture traced whole in its top-left tile
# (points in the picture's pixels), its other tiles E (draw nothing);
# X: a picture of text (its first tile, pen), then L lines: x0 x1 baseline height text.
# H (after S or T): an area of the picture hiding the 3D, a rectangle x0 y0 x1 y1 or a convex polygon.

